#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:eh_account_collections.field_eh_collections_case__total_overdue_amount
msgid "Total Overdue Amount"
msgstr "逾期總金額"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_collections.field_eh_collections_case__followup_count
msgid "Total follow-up messages sent across this case's lifetime."
msgstr "此案例整個生命週期內發送的跟進訊息總數。"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:eh_account_collections.report_case_statement
msgid "Total open"
msgstr "未結總額"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:eh_account_collections.report_case_statement
msgid "Total overdue"
msgstr "逾期總額"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_collections.field_eh_collections_followup_level__days_overdue
msgid ""
"Trigger this level when the case's days_overdue_max is at least this many "
"days. Levels fire in ascending order; a case at 45 days overdue with levels "
"at 7 / 30 / 60 sits on the 30 level until it crosses 60."
msgstr ""
"當案件的 days_overdue_max 至少達到此天數時觸發此級別。級別按升序觸發；逾期 45 天且級別設定為 7 / 30 / 60 "
"的案件將保持在 30 級別，直到超過 60。"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_collections.field_eh_collections_case__is_resolved
msgid "True when the case is in a terminal stage."
msgstr "當案例處於終止階段時為 True。"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_collections.field_eh_collections_case__broken_promise
msgid ""
"True when the latest promise to pay has lapsed (promise date is in the past)"
" and the case has not been resolved. The broken-promise cron escalates these"
" cases."
msgstr "當最近一次付款承諾已失效（承諾日期已過）且案例尚未解決時為 True。失約 cron 會升級處理這些案例。"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:eh_account_collections.report_case_statement
msgid "Type"
msgstr "類型"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_collections.field_eh_collections_case__activity_exception_decoration
msgid "Type of the exception activity on record."
msgstr "記錄的異常活動的類型。"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:eh_account_collections.selection__eh_collections_case__priority__3
msgid "Urgent"
msgstr "緊急"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_collections.field_eh_collections_stage__is_default
msgid ""
"Used by the auto creator to place new cases. Only one stage should carry "
"this flag at any given time."
msgstr "由自動建立器用於放置新案例。在任何給定時間只應有一個階段帶有此旗標。"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_collections.field_eh_collections_late_fee_wizard__flat_amount
msgid "Used when fee_mode = 'flat'."
msgstr "當 fee_mode = 'flat' 時使用。"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_collections.field_eh_collections_late_fee_wizard__percent_per_month
msgid ""
"Used when fee_mode = 'percent'. Applied to the overdue amount, prorated by "
"days_overdue / 30."
msgstr "當 fee_mode = 'percent' 時使用。套用於逾期金額，並按 days_overdue / 30 按比例分攤。"

#. module: eh_account_collections
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:eh_account_collections.field_eh_collections_action__user_id
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:eh_account_collections.report_case_statement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:eh_account_collections.view_eh_collections_action_search
msgid "User"
msgstr "使用者"

